### Healthcheck
GET http://localhost:8080/healthz


### Readiness Probe
GET http://localhost:8080/ready


### Prometheus Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/metrics


### Search Routes (Bounding Box)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: test-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boundingBox": {
    "minLng": -2.984805,
    "minLat": 54.418630,
    "maxLng": -2.947941,
    "maxLat": 54.438327
  }
}


### Search Routes (Full Text Query)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: test-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Locking"
}


### Search Routes (Sorting)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: test-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sort": {
    "field": "difficulty",
    "direction": "ASC"
  }
}


### Search Routes (Nearby: Lat/Lng)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: test-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nearby": {
    "lat": 54.42,
    "lon": -2.97,
    "distance": 5000
  }
}


### Search Routes (Nearby: place)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: test-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nearby": {
    "place": "ambleside",
    "distance": 5000
  }
}


### Search Routes (with Facets)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: test-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Locking",
  "facets": ["surface"]
}


### Search Routes (GeoJSON Output)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: test-key
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/geo+json

{
  "boundingBox": {
    "minLng": -2.984805,
    "minLat": 54.418630,
    "maxLng": -2.947941,
    "maxLat": 54.438327
  }
}


### Get Route by Object ID
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/e5475bfb0b17ef4d31e5051699f828ee
X-API-Key: test-key


### CORS Preflight
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
Origin: http://example.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: X-API-Key, Content-Type


### Unauthorized (No API Key)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "test"
}


### Rate Limited (send multiple times rapidly)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: test-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "test"
}
